3번: <fieldset>, <legend>, <label> 태그를 이용한 로그인 폼HTML<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>로그인 폼 만들기</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h3>로그인 폼</h3>
    <hr>
    <form>
        <fieldset>
            <legend>Login</legend>
            <label>Username <input type="text"></label>
            <label>Password <input type="password"></label>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</body>
</html>

